<title>HONG KONG: HK Oct property deals up 193 pct in value on year.</title>
<headline>HK Oct property deals up 193 pct in value on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong recorded 13,889 sale and purchase agreements worth HK$48.4 billion for residential and non-residential building units in October, the government Land Registry said on Monday.</p>
<p>The value of the agreements rose 65.8 percent from September 1996 and 193.1 percent from October last year, it said.</p>
<p>The number of deals rose 31.7 percent from September this year and 121.7 percent from October 1995, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
